00:00:51.351 --> 00:00:52.419
just in one day alone.

00:00:52.419 --> 00:00:52.952
Just walk us through

00:00:52.952 --> 00:00:54.888
what we know on that front

00:00:56.089 --> 00:00:56.523
Yeah, I mean,

00:00:56.523 --> 00:00:58.792
this is kind of the culmination of a week

00:00:58.792 --> 00:01:00.360
now of Yevgeny Prigozhin

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:01.394
using the Telegram

00:01:01.394 --> 00:01:02.395
