But the outcome of this

00:01:10.403 --> 00:01:12.138
extraordinary bout

00:01:12.138 --> 00:01:13.506
of criticism of Russia's

00:01:13.506 --> 00:01:15.008
top brass as being today,

00:01:15.008 --> 00:01:16.709
Guinea prigozhin to claim

00:01:16.709 --> 00:01:17.177
that russia's

00:01:17.177 --> 00:01:18.545
ministry of defense troops

00:01:18.545 --> 00:01:20.513
have moved into the outskirts of back

00:01:20.513 --> 00:01:22.682
around his Volga, the mercenaries

00:01:22.882 --> 00:01:24.584
who hold the city

00:01:24.584 --> 00:01:25.919
