00:01:25.919 --> 00:01:27.654
24 hours have given up

00:01:27.654 --> 00:01:28.855
five square kilometers

00:01:28.855 --> 00:01:32.225
to the northwest of that city area.

00:01:32.258 --> 00:01:33.693
Now, he says this now is giving

00:01:33.693 --> 00:01:35.562
Ukrainian armed forces the high ground,

00:01:35.562 --> 00:01:37.464
