00:02:19.005 --> 00:02:20.373
That is simply the worst

00:02:20.373 --> 00:02:21.908
signal, almost unimaginable,

00:02:21.908 --> 00:02:23.143
frankly, a year ago

00:02:23.143 --> 00:02:24.577
in Putin's Russia

00:02:24.577 --> 00:02:27.347
showing how rattled how this unified

00:02:27.614 --> 00:02:28.114
Moscow's

00:02:28.114 --> 00:02:30.583
military elite are in this key city.

00:02:30.583 --> 00:02:31.351
That's been such

00:02:31.351 --> 00:02:32.919
a symbolic task for them.

00:02:32.919 --> 00:02:34.220
They've utterly failed

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:35.788
to comprehensively take

00:02:35.788 --> 00:02:37.790
and are now, in fact, seeing Ukraine

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:38.791
in small amounts.

00:02:38.791 --> 00:02:39.659
Let's not overstate

00:02:39.659 --> 00:02:41.794
the significance of these advances

00:02:41.961 --> 00:02:43.263
in small amounts, though,

00:02:43.263 --> 00:02:44.998
