00:02:46.566 --> 00:02:48.768
What it absolutely, unequivocally does

00:02:49.068 --> 00:02:50.703
in the days and weeks ahead

00:02:50.703 --> 00:02:51.604
is give a signal

00:02:51.604 --> 00:02:53.540
of probably low Russian morale

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:55.141
low Russian cohesion

00:02:55.141 --> 00:02:57.644
ahead of Ukrainian counter offensive,

00:02:57.644 --> 00:02:58.711
which senior U.S.

00:02:58.711 --> 00:02:59.946
officials said

00:03:00.013 --> 00:03:02.882
has begun its shaping operation state.

00:03:02.882 --> 00:03:04.150
That's essentially where key

00:03:04.150 --> 00:03:06.619
parts of Russian infrastructure,

00:03:06.619 --> 00:03:08.988
fuel supplies, other elements

00:03:09.422 --> 00:03:10.423
of their occupation

00:03:10.423 --> 00:03:11.090
