00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:13.393
eastern and Crimea in Ukraine

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:15.795
may well end up being targeted

00:03:15.795 --> 00:03:17.130
with precision strikes that face

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:18.264
what we've been seeing, frankly,

00:03:18.264 --> 00:03:18.965
over the past two

00:03:18.965 --> 00:03:19.566
to three weeks,

00:03:19.566 --> 00:03:20.633
citing reports

00:03:20.633 --> 00:03:22.202
