00:03:32.478 --> 00:03:34.080
and to this startling

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:35.448
display of Russian

00:03:35.448 --> 00:03:37.083
disunity and tiny,

00:03:37.083 --> 00:03:39.118
tiny amounts of retreat

00:03:39.719 --> 00:03:43.156
around a city which they've invested

00:03:43.256 --> 00:03:44.123
That's just the wrong

00:03:44.123 --> 00:03:45.725
word, entirely squandered

00:03:45.725 --> 00:03:47.460
so many thousands of human lives

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:49.596
and trying to capture Saint.

00:03:49.596 --> 00:03:50.830
Nick Paton Walsh live for us there.

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:52.232
Thank you so much.

00:03:52.232 --> 00:03:53.066
Well, Ukrainian President

00:03:53.066 --> 00:03:53.967
